    "difficulty": "Very easy",
    "action_shots": true,
    "introduction": "This guide shows the best way to properly glue the glass of a coin display case into its place. To ensure the bond is strong, make sure the areas being glued are clean, dry, and have space to set without interference. The coin glass case is made of wood, and the glass is a Plexiglas mix. This process involves cleaning the glass with a paper towel and glass cleaner, then using super glue to attach the pane.",
